{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Live at peace with everyone if you [Eb]can
Leave [Gm7]room for the wrath that God takes [Eb]
[Bb]Vengeance is mine, I will [Eb]repay
[Gm7]The Lord has spoken, we o[Eb]bey
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
If your [Gm7]enemy is hungry, feed him
[Eb]If he is thirsty, give him drink
[Gm7]Do this and you will heap
[Eb]Burning coals upon his head
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Do not be [Eb]overcome by evil
[Gm7]But overcome e[Eb]vil with good
