{comment: Instrumental}
| [Bb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]As far as it depends on [Eb]you
[Gm7]Choose the path of peace [Eb]today
[Bb]Do not take revenge, [Eb]dear friends
[Gm7]Trust the judgment God will [Eb]pay
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Do not [Eb]be overcome by evil
[Gm7]But overcome e[Eb]vil with good
